 de las zonas residenciales más consolidadas de la Costa del Sol.\n\nCon licencia ‌turística ‌ya ‌concedida, ‌LOMAS ‌18 ‌representa una ‌excelente oportunidad ‌tanto como residencia habitual, elegante ‌vivienda ‌vacacional ‌o ‌inversión ‌con un gran potencial ‌de ‌rentabilidad ‌en ‌la ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol.","en":"Located in the sought-after Lomas del Marqués, this beautifully renovated duplex penthouse combines contemporary design, generous outdoor space, and a highly convenient location. Within a short distance of everyday amenities and the Atalaya International School, it offers an ideal lifestyle for both families and investors.\n\nDesigned across two levels, the property features 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, with bright open-plan living spaces that flow seamlessly onto the terraces. \n\nThe penthouse also includes two underground parking spaces and a private storage room, providing practicality alongside comfort. Set within a secure gated community with 24-hour security, residents can enjoy peace of mind in one of the area’s most established residential ‌settings.\n\nWith ‌a ‌tourist ‌licence ‌already ‌in place, ‌LOMAS 18 ‌represents an excellent opportunity as ‌a ‌permanent ‌residence, ‌stylish ‌holiday home, or high-potential ‌rental ‌investment ‌on ‌the ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Colegios","Excelente","Comunitaria","Mar","Montaña","Panorámicas","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Trastero","Amueblada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Más de uno","Privado"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Schools","Excellent","Communal","Sea","Mountain","Panoramic","Private Terrace","Gym","Storage Room","Fully Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","More Than One","Private"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}